<title>ESTONIA: FAKTO H1 NET PROFIT 773,000 KROONS.</title>
<headline>FAKTO H1 NET PROFIT 773,000 KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First six months of 1997</p>
<p>					(million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				773,000 vs   1.7</p>
<p> Turnover				    159.9 vs 180.5</p>
<p> Operating costs			   158.6 vs 181.6</p>
<p> Operating profit			    3.7 vs   4.5</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				1.3 vs   2.1</p>
<p>NOTE -- Fakto, a car wholesaler and retailer, compared the</p>
<p>first half of 1997 with the results for the whole of 1996.</p>
</text>
